# The failover sweep's ratchet (ADR-0055 §11): every cell of the base
# catalogue that fails today, with the decision section that owns its
# correction. A change that makes a cell pass removes its line; a new failure
# is never added without its owner. The list only shrinks.
#
# The owner is read from the finding: a missing or extra CDR §5, a final under
# another tag than the provisional §3 at a kill and §4 in a split, a request a
# copy sends without the record of what the dead owner sent §4, the non-2xx
# final of a dialled INVITE nobody ACKs §12, a PRACK or an in-dialog request
# left unanswered §2, and any other finding of a split cell §7.

